# Ember uses NO environment variables in the client application.
#
# Today Ember runs as a Claude artifact, where the platform injects the Claude
# API key at runtime. The app ships with NO key in its code — this is intentional.
# See docs/KNOWN-ISSUES.md, Blocker B.
#
# The ONLY place an API key ever belongs is a FUTURE server-side proxy
# (Cloudflare Worker / Netlify Function / Vercel Edge Function) that holds the
# key and forwards to the Anthropic API. Point the app's fetch at that proxy.
#
# NEVER place this key in index.html or any client-side bundle — anything in the
# client is public the moment it is hosted.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
